{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "e3b7a2f0-pagos-wompi-essentia-0001",
    "name": "Dulce Esencia - Módulo de Pagos (Wompi Sandbox)",
    "description": "Colección del módulo de pagos de Dulce Esencia. Requiere un token JWT válido (usa la colección principal ESSENTIA-Postman-Completo para hacer login y copiar el token en la variable {{token}} del entorno).\n\nAntes de probar 'Crear pago', asegúrate de tener configuradas las variables WOMPI_PUBLIC_KEY, WOMPI_PRIVATE_KEY, WOMPI_EVENTS_SECRET y WOMPI_INTEGRITY_SECRET en backend/.env con tus llaves de Sandbox (ver docs/modulo-pagos-wompi.md).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "payment_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "reference",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Crear pago",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Idempotency-Key",
            "value": "prueba-postman-001",
            "description": "Opcional. Repetir la misma llave evita crear un pago duplicado."
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/pagos",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "pagos"
          ]
        },
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"monto\": 50000,\n  \"moneda\": \"COP\",\n  \"correo_cliente\": \"cliente@example.com\",\n  \"nombre_cliente\": \"Cliente Demo\",\n  \"descripcion\": \"Pago de prueba\",\n  \"proveedor\": \"wompi\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// Guarda payment_id y reference para usarlos en las demás peticiones de esta colección.",
              "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
              "    const datos = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('payment_id', datos.payment_id);",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('reference', datos.reference);",
              "}",
              "pm.test('Se creó el pago (201) y trae checkout_url', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().checkout_url).to.be.a('string');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Obtener pago por id",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/pagos/{{payment_id}}",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "pagos",
            "{{payment_id}}"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Obtener pago por referencia",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/pagos/referencia/{{reference}}",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "pagos",
            "referencia",
            "{{reference}}"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Sincronizar pago con Wompi (/sync)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/pagos/{{payment_id}}/sync",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "pagos",
            "{{payment_id}}",
            "sync"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Webhook Wompi (simulación de evento transaction.updated)",
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/webhooks/wompi",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "webhooks",
            "wompi"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Wompi Sandbox llama a este endpoint automáticamente cuando el cliente termina el Checkout — esta petición es solo para SIMULAR un evento a mano. El checksum de este ejemplo NO es válido (no conoces tu WOMPI_EVENTS_SECRET real desde Postman): úsala para probar que un checksum inválido se rechaza con 400, o recalcula el checksum tú mismo siguiendo docs/modulo-pagos-wompi.md.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"event\": \"transaction.updated\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"transaction\": {\n      \"id\": \"1234-1610641025-49201\",\n      \"amount_in_cents\": 5000000,\n      \"reference\": \"{{reference}}\",\n      \"customer_email\": \"cliente@example.com\",\n      \"currency\": \"COP\",\n      \"payment_method_type\": \"NEQUI\",\n      \"status\": \"APPROVED\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"environment\": \"test\",\n  \"signature\": {\n    \"properties\": [\n      \"transaction.id\",\n      \"transaction.status\",\n      \"transaction.amount_in_cents\"\n    ],\n    \"checksum\": \"REEMPLAZA-ESTE-VALOR-CON-EL-CHECKSUM-CALCULADO\"\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": 1530291411,\n  \"sent_at\": \"2018-07-20T16:45:05.000Z\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Health check",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /health",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /health/db",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/health/db",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health",
                "db"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}